`packages/` and `apps/web/` originates there, unless listed under
[Firo-authored](#firo-authored-code) below.

| | |
| --- | --- |
| Upstream project | https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw |
| Upstream commit | `35e854ecf7a1ace3467922965ce07ec1a6f0ea54` |
| Upstream commit date | 2026-09-29 |
| Upstream commit subject | `feat(app): label E+ banner Upgrade / Sign in (#12204)` |
