## Telemetry

**Firo sends nothing anywhere.** Upstream reported crashes to Sentry and shipped
a sitemap, an AI backend, a Firebase-backed share-link store and a Socket.IO
collaboration server. All of it is removed. `TopErrorBoundary` now shows the
error to the user and offers to copy it to the clipboard; it does not transmit
anything. This is a requirement, not an accident — see NFR-3 in
[`docs/prd/05-non-functional-requirements.md`](docs/prd/05-non-functional-requirements.md).

